{%- comment -%}
  Homepage colour match (2026-11-25). One colour per action on the whole homepage:
  red (#e1261c, the logo red) = get a quote, blue = call, navy (#071a3d) = dark bands and the footer.
  Before this the same "get a quote" action was green in some sections, blue in others and red on the Quote card.
  Also: on phones the ten service cards sit in one swipe row instead of a list about 2,000 px long.
  Nothing here changes any wording. Remove this section to go back to the old colours.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .tho-qbtn:not(.tho-qbtn--ghost), .tho-card--pro .tho-qbtn:not(.tho-qbtn--ghost), .rj-btn--q,
  .thh-btn--ghost, .thh-btn--light {
    background: #e1261c !important; background-image: none !important; border-color: #e1261c !important; color: #fff !important;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(225, 38, 28, .28) !important;
  }
  .tho-qbtn:not(.tho-qbtn--ghost):hover, .rj-btn--q:hover, .thh-btn--ghost:hover, .thh-btn--light:hover { background: #c71e15 !important; }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .thh-grid--svc { display: flex !important; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; scrollbar-width: none; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; }
    .thh-grid--svc::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .thh-grid--svc > .thh-card { flex: 0 0 80%; scroll-snap-align: start; }
  }
</style>

